  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:340px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-crimson pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Blueprint Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Malware_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20210417005827\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Malware (Ben 10)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Malware_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20210417005827\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Malware_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20210417005827 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Malware_%28Ben_10%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20210417005827 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Malware (Ben 10)\" width=\"270\" height=\"310\" data-image-key=\"Malware_%28Ben_10%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Malware (Ben 10).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Malware (Ben 10) was able to absorb the blueprints of the Omnitrix upon contacting it.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb blueprints.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb blueprints</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" i